      "writtenOn": "2023-09-27T14:12:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If you change it to lrintf, do you see performance improvements in your profiles?\n\nI don\u0027t recall all of the options I looked into, but I thought I went through a number of ways of rounding. My main concern with lrintf is that it is dependent on the current rounding mode",
